      ],
      "rationale": "C0000 accurately defines a material discrepancy by negative reference to immaterial discrepancies in 8 FAM 403.1-5. However, the draft assigns a source attribution to 'Department' citing text ('Department guidance') located much later in paragraph d, which is an erroneous source attribution for this definitional rule.",
