          "quote": "The applicant must explain any material discrepancies between the name on the application and the name recorded in the evidence of U.S. citizenship/non-citizen U.S. nationality and the evidence of identity (see 22 CFR 51.25).",
          "start": 183,
          "end": 408
        }
      ],
      "rationale": "C0001 covers the requirement for the applicant to explain material discrepancies.",
      "status": "covered"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:rulespec:audit-unit:8bff5cd81f00f667cb8f799b61c426c6b43fb490de2f7d097b1a320967177b33",
      "claim_ids": [
        "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:036690ae5e6ca04a41045e67196d8f9a393e15732f00ae43b6bb337b58415b12"
      ],
      "source_spans": [
        {
          "source_id": "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:document:aa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc",
          "quote": "Material discrepancies between the name recorded on the application, the applicant's evidence of U.S. citizenship/non-citizen U.S. nationality, or the evidence of identity must be documented by submission of one or more of the documents listed in this section (see an exception for married names in 8 FAM 403.1-4(C)).",
          "start": 413,
          "end": 730
        }
      ],
      "rationale": "C0002 covers the general requirement to document material discrepancies using acceptable documents listed.",
      "status": "covered"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:rulespec:audit-unit:a7686ed3041c48718c59e8d6cfc2ef1248979d04900751583bd01228534eb656",
      "claim_ids": [
        "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:036690ae5e6ca04a41045e67196d8f9a393e15732f00ae43b6bb337b58415b12"
      ],
      "source_spans": [
        {
          "source_id": "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:document:aa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc",
          "quote": "(see an exception for married names in 8 FAM 403.1-4(C))",
          "start": 673,
          "end": 729
        }
      ],
      "rationale": "C0002 incorporates the cross-reference exception for married names in 8 FAM 403.1-4(C).",
      "status": "covered"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:rulespec:audit-unit:d7452acb54d6328e1abf592f6663760d521dba372cdc2b35064e172ebdecd834",
      "claim_ids": [
        "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:036690ae5e6ca04a41045e67196d8f9a393e15732f00ae43b6bb337b58415b12"
