          "quote": "(4) Documentation demonstrating change of name by operation of state law; or",
          "start": 960,
          "end": 1036
        }
      ],
      "rationale": "C0002 includes documentation of name change by operation of state law as an acceptable document type.",
      "status": "covered"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:rulespec:audit-unit:57657c1009240da9043b02d61ffbd2be744d4ef4494fbb6c880d1ea2c6acbc10",
      "claim_ids": [
        "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:036690ae5e6ca04a41045e67196d8f9a393e15732f00ae43b6bb337b58415b12"
      ],
      "source_spans": [
        {
          "source_id": "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:document:aa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc",
          "quote": "(5) Documentation of customary usage.",
          "start": 1038,
          "end": 1075
        }
      ],
      "rationale": "C0002 includes documentation of customary usage as an acceptable document type.",
      "status": "covered"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:rulespec:audit-unit:ab3f4c9fc0a1374c48c33c2c6f43ac3338b3b433cde1132b594c26d65469634c",
      "claim_ids": [
        "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:ed6eca216b18fcd087c82dc03fbbf630f5cd8e3b92293cd23062e85e29fd94ac"
      ],
      "source_spans": [
        {
          "source_id": "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:document:aa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc",
          "quote": "NOTE: Evidence of material name changes must be reviewed for evidence of counterfeiting or alteration (see 8 FAM 201.1)",
          "start": 1077,
          "end": 1196
        }
      ],
      "rationale": "C0003 covers the requirement to inspect material name change evidence for counterfeiting or alteration.",
      "status": "covered"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:rulespec:audit-unit:b96681f1720d25a02a5309765a9b59ecae7d4fd03402aae240352430e4f5afec",
      "claim_ids": [
        "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:792cfe4bd8cb212a79e2b3eb96ff18f4def9ea2affc055b761717fcbbc4a2995"
      ],
      "source_spans": [
        {
          "source_id": "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:document:aa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc",
          "quote": "The applicant may not continue to use a previous name after a material name change unless the name change documentation specifically permits the applicant to continue using that name (see 8 FAM 403.1-6 regarding “known as” names).",
          "start": 1201,
          "end": 1431
        }
      ],
      "rationale": "C0004 covers the prohibition on continued use of a previous name absent specific permission.",
      "status": "covered"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:rulespec:audit-unit:639553575340f3977d5e7a35276b2c975514fc553292a63104a92ba90385aaaa",
      "claim_ids": [
        "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:4787e49b95aa0a916bee08dc047912949467e82e158310ec287f69061c041d61"
      ],
      "source_spans": [
        {
          "source_id": "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:document:aa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc",
          "quote": "Consequently, under 22 CFR 51.23(c), evidence of identity might be required in accordance with Department guidance to establish the name that best identifies the applicant:",
          "start": 1498,
          "end": 1670
        }
      ],
      "rationale": "C0005 covers the provision that evidence of identity might be required under 22 CFR 51.23(c) and Department guidance.",
      "status": "covered"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:rulespec:audit-unit:8991a42afe4952ecf16e71a5fe6839ff4097c7cbc5cb3e5d8a427eb72c421fc9",
      "claim_ids": [
        "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:34554b8326c00bc5120319066d6695e156c66ac2f0fcb071919c1fa2b6802844"
      ],
      "source_spans": [
        {
          "source_id": "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:document:aa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc",
          "quote": "If the applicant has had a material name change more than one year prior to applying on form DS-11 but has not updated her/his ID to reflect the material name change, you must suspend the application to request an acceptable ID in the new name.",
          "start": 1676,
          "end": 1920
        }
      ],
      "rationale": "C0006 covers the requirement to suspend the application to request updated ID when a material name change occurred more than one year prior.",
      "status": "covered"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:rulespec:audit-unit:e85763b7af2abb4d571f24baa8c42e4483f6543600430ee4b5364f95da291377",
      "claim_ids": [
        "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:d823f47f8a5d7e24069b40c98ef03d2b632503e7dd4da3df6fd565b0ca21f659"
      ],
      "source_spans": [
        {
          "source_id": "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:document:aa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc",
          "quote": "If there is insufficient time to request that the applicant submit acceptable ID prior to urgent or emergency travel, a limited-validity passport may be issued in the requested name;",
          "start": 1921,
          "end": 2103
        }
      ],
      "rationale": "C0007 covers the permission to issue a limited-validity passport in the requested name for urgent or emergency travel.",
      "status": "covered"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:rulespec:audit-unit:40f033d88b494d55d25bcaf90701c7ae50cd05e43a94d135c3ca69dde77cbb45",
      "claim_ids": [
        "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:fe2a8888cd41a43f96f4cff7d89ff55858f2808a637b575ac1f41c38276cee95"
      ],
      "source_spans": [
        {
          "source_id": "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:document:aa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc",
          "quote": "The applicant generally will need the name change documentation to change the name on her/his ID.",
          "start": 2109,
          "end": 2206
        }
      ],
      "rationale": "C0008 covers the statement that applicants generally will need name change documentation to update ID.",
      "status": "covered"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:rulespec:audit-unit:a8ce111ce230c51b61e4e6fec1cfa06f8d04a6efd9a779687c3cd3cc4096b01e",
      "claim_ids": [
        "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:cdcf4e0a588e3da865beac729930582bc1137156d866ddfc306e05424723c0ed"
      ],
      "source_spans": [
        {
          "source_id": "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:document:aa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc",
          "quote": "You must fully notate the name change documentation prior to returning the documentation, including that the documentation was \"seen and returned,\" to the applicant with the information request letter (IRL);",
          "start": 2207,
          "end": 2414
        }
      ],
      "rationale": "C0009 covers the requirement to notate name change documentation as 'seen and returned' prior to sending it back with an IRL.",
      "status": "covered"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:rulespec:audit-unit:041282f32adfeba3e02b114313abfb158174fad18894b5a867bc3f691e979fb5",
      "claim_ids": [
        "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:d6e60771ba8e74d05d86ddd9d3580f71db38714cbc627de8b889a7a58373ed2e"
      ],
      "source_spans": [
        {
          "source_id": "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:document:aa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc",
          "quote": "Applicants who have had a material name change within one year of applying on a form DS-11 do not need to submit ID in the new name.",
          "start": 2424,
          "end": 2556
        }
      ],
      "rationale": "C0010 covers the exemption from submitting ID in the new name for material name changes within one year of applying on Form DS-11.",
      "status": "covered"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:rulespec:audit-unit:368b4f0d1a4faa14b3afb302bf3af14918b7cd6de3c2a0d8c67621e3877be044",
      "claim_ids": [
        "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:1727076a307207ee4484b6ed0e696d9e97d146a464bc61f900edc954389c1ad1"
      ],
      "source_spans": [
        {
          "source_id": "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:document:aa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc",
          "quote": "However, if the ID has not yet been changed, they must submit their name change documentation.",
          "start": 2557,
          "end": 2651
        }
      ],
      "rationale": "C0011 covers the requirement to submit name change documentation if ID has not yet been changed within the one-year period.",
      "status": "covered"
    }
  ]
